# Goals, attempts and source-faithful satisfaction evidence.

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestedByDream|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "requested by dream"
msgstr "demandée à partir d’un récit de rêve"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestedByDream|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual DreamReport recollection episode from which an AttentionRequest was derived. This extension-owned provenance link does not turn the episode into an enduring document or assert that dream content occurred externally."
msgstr "Épisode réel de remémoration DreamReport dont une AttentionRequest est dérivée. Ce lien de provenance appartenant à l’extension ne transforme pas l’épisode en document durable et n’affirme pas la réalité externe du rêve."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestedByDream|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this relation and its context."
msgstr "Utiliser lorsque la source fournit explicitement cette relation et son contexte."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestedByDream|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing missing source bindings or inferring execution and success from this record alone."
msgstr "Éviter d’inventer des liens source absents ou de déduire exécution et réussite de ce seul enregistrement."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestedByDream|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain actual source values, identities and attribution; preserve supplied wording, language and direction."
msgstr "Conserver valeurs, identités et attribution réelles de la source ; préserver formulation, langue et direction fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestedByDream|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Source evidence and configuration remain distinct. Competing attributed records may coexist without a preferred claim."
msgstr "Les preuves source et la configuration restent distinctes. Des enregistrements attribués concurrents peuvent coexister sans déclaration privilégiée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestedByDream|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:requestedByDream ex:target ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:requestedByDream ex:target ."

# Source-faithful conversation records.

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inspiredByDream|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "inspired by dream"
msgstr "inspiré par le rêve"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inspiredByDream|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual DreamReport recollection episode from which a message was composed, specializing source derivation. The episode remains an occurrent; dream content is not asserted as external fact and no message delivery is inferred."
msgstr "Épisode réel de remémoration DreamReport à partir duquel un message a été composé, spécialisation de la dérivation source. L’épisode reste un occurrent ; le contenu rêvé n’est pas affirmé comme fait externe et aucune livraison n’est inférée."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inspiredByDream|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly supplies this record or field."
msgstr "À employer lorsque la source fournit explicitement cet enregistrement ou ce champ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inspiredByDream|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring identity, delivery, verification or execution from missing source evidence."
msgstr "Éviter de déduire identité, livraison, vérification ou exécution de preuves source manquantes."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inspiredByDream|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain exact source values, their scope and attribution; preserve supplied language and base direction."
msgstr "Conserver les valeurs source exactes, leur portée et leur attribution ; préserver la langue et la direction de base fournies."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inspiredByDream|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Independent source claims coexist. These declarations preserve evidence without authenticating the provider or executing its operation."
msgstr "Les déclarations source indépendantes coexistent. Ces déclarations conservent les preuves sans authentifier le fournisseur ni exécuter son opération."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inspiredByDream|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain the supplied value for gmeow:inspiredByDream."
msgstr "Conserver la valeur fournie pour gmeow:inspiredByDream."
